*Phase 1: Requirement Analysis and Dataset Selection (blue)*
*Phase 2: Architecture Design and Model Selection (blue)*
*Phase 3: Preprocessing Pipeline Design (green)*
*Phase 4: Training Strategy Design, including Knowledge Distillation sub-phase (green/orange)*
