#### MobileCount Knowledge Distillation Evaluation

MobileCount was evaluated in both its baseline (directly supervised) and distilled (teacher-improved) forms on the NWPU-Crowd validation set. Table 4.13 summarises the performance of both configurations, and Table 4.14 documents the per-epoch distillation training progression.

**[Table 4.13 — MobileCount Performance Metrics — NWPU-Crowd Validation Set]**

